00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.040
Yuri!!! On Ice!!!

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:02.960
Best opening!

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:04.720
Yuri!! On Ice!!!

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:06.280
Best ending!

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:08.460
Yuri!! On Ice!!!

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:10.380
