00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:13.380
Best man service... Yuri!! On Ice!!!

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:15.200
Most dicks sucked in an anime....

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:16.820
Yuri!! On Ice!!!

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:18.620
Best pork bowl cutlet...

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.280
Yuri!! On Ice!!!

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:22.460
Best Yuri!! On Ice!!!....

00:02:22.460 --> 00:02:24.220
Y̶u̶r̶i̶!̶!̶ ̶O̶n̶ ̶I̶c̶e̶!̶!̶!̶ FREE! ETERNAL SUMMER!!

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:27.620
Actually I thought Yuri!! On Ice deserved all those awards...

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:30.260
Alright, You can go fuck yourself

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:33.540
And I think now will be a good time to see how the rest of the community are taking this.

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:36.520
*Raging intensifies

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:41.240
Hey you know, at least a few of the awards given were actually deserved

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:43.320
I mean Deku won best hero

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:46.120
Mob Psycho got best action and best fight scene.

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:51.240
and yes the best comedy of this year deservedly went to the Crunchyroll Anime Awards.

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:53.920
*Laughing

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:58.080
But the we get the villain of the year which is of course going to be Kira from JoJo's

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:01.340
I mean there is literally no better choice this year than Kira from JoJo's

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:02.980
I mean like... (*Silence)

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:04.720
