00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:21.660
Madhouse breaking their curse and announcing One Punch Man season 2

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:22.680
Best couple...

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:24.380
Crunchyroll x Funimation

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:25.700
The match made in heaven

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:26.800
Best boy...

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.980
yet another JoJo's reference that came out last year.

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:29.900
Best girl...

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:31.560
There was only ever going to be one

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:32.600
Best comedy...

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:34.380
Malik Obama's twitter page

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:35.480
Best animation...

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:38.840
This really realistic volleyball scene from Haikyuu's olympic's arc

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:40.200
Drama of the year...

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:42.380
The rise and fall of Leafyishere

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:43.300
Best opening...

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:45.540
The glory gospels singing the Evangelion theme

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:46.780
Best ending...

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:48.140
The brexit results

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:51.060
And anime of the year undoubtedly goes to...

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:57.860
2016 itself for being by far the most entertaining thing to come out in decades

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:01.520
And that was it for the Gigguk anime awards of 2016

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:06.040
But for real tho, i don't why people are getting so riled up at Crunchyroll for the anime award results

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:10.760
If anything it's just proven something that we've all known for a very long time

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:13.420
That everyone but you....

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:14.720
Has shit taste

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:25.460
